    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The class reunion has ended.</strong></h2> Old friends <strong>Neal </strong>and <strong>Jack</strong>, awkwardly reunited, take a late-night drive over to their old elementary school, shut down for summer break. For some reason, it's open.<br><br><i>Our Dirge</i> is a game made in RPGMaker MV. It's somewhere between a visual novel, adventure game, and walking simulator. It's about a lot of things. I guess it's mostly about being an adult.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2>Meander through hallways and make offhand comments from the perspective of <strong>Neal Lin</strong>. Following close behind you and chiming in is <strong>Jack Langel</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080730/extras/5d560ec44762436398abeb8e32d49912.poster.avif?t=1747945916\" width=538 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080730/extras/5d560ec44762436398abeb8e32d49912.webm?t=1747945916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080730/extras/5d560ec44762436398abeb8e32d49912.mp4?t=1747945916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Miscellaneous conversations<br></li><li>Dialogue choice &amp; multiple endings<br></li><li>Lotta walkin' around and checkin' stuff out<br></li><li>Trying to figure out how to turn on the lights<br></li><li>About 3 hours of all of that ^</li></ul><strong>And</strong>....<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Goofy character animation<br></li><li>Unique digitally painted backgrounds<br></li><li>Cool soundtrack i did (it's got synthesizers...)<br></li><li>Mid-aughts to early tens American pop culture garbage that is not worth remembering</li></ul><br><i>(No need to worry about getting a &quot;bad ending&quot; or making &quot;bad decisions&quot; -- everything is worthwhile. Listen to your heart!)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080730/extras/9beb351405e14ee4bcd4e2a602353af2.poster.avif?t=1747945916\" width=624 height=495 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080730/extras/9beb351405e14ee4bcd4e2a602353af2.webm?t=1747945916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></i>",
