    "short_description": "It's June 2023 in Columbus, Ohio -- 10 years since Neal and Jack graduated, and 8 years since they last spoke. Follow two once-best friends' reluctant descent through classrooms and memories in Our Dirge, a game about growing up in a certain place &amp; time, and making up for the time we lost.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe Our Dirge demo... really impresses with the detailed pixel art environments and beautifully written dialogue. The storytelling is excellent and the characters are well fleshed out, making you emotionally invested in their lives. There is a real sense of doom in the air though, so maybe don\u2019t get too invested in them!\u201d<br>-Alpha Beta Gamer<br><br>\u201cwell I share a birthday with one of these guys.... so thats cool.\u201d<br>-The Poopsmith<br><br>\u201cCheck that shit out...\u201d<br>-me<br>",
